  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Understanding migration dynamics between Uzbekistan and Sweden</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will aim to enhance understanding of migration and mobility dynamics between Sweden and Uzbekistan through increased access to tools and methods that can address data gaps and needs. By designing tools that will enable the eventual research and building partnerships with local stakeholders, IOM will contribute to improved migration management policies and responses. In this three-month project to prepare for a comprehensive research, IOM will establish an outreach plan to ensure involvement of all relevant data actors and decision makers. In consultation with national experts and tapping into IOM&#x2019;s existing expertise, IOM will develop research tools for systematic information collection on migration flows and mobility patterns between Sweden and Uzbekistan, including journey experiences, vulnerabilities (including gender-specific concerns), population movement intentions, and trends are available.</narrative>
  </description>
